WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Start. Pause. Finish. Clock actions live in the desktop companion.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.100
Start on the dashboard. Your shift state is the first thing you see.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.600
Use the Worktivity controls. Clock in, pause or resume from the dashboard.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.000
Clock out when the day ends. Worktivity confirms the state before Work OS mirrors it.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.200
Worktivity owns the clock. The browser reports attendance; it never changes it.
